<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main>
  <h2>Download your data</h2>
  <p>You get one file (JSON) with a copy of what you have on Global Village:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your profile, posts (with their edit history), reposts, likes and bookmarks.</li>
    <li>Your friends, friend requests, and the accounts you blocked or muted.</li>
    <li>Your direct messages (both sides of each conversation), your groups, and the group messages you sent.</li>
    <li>Your notifications and the reports you filed.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Pictures are listed as links, and the picture files are not inside the download.</p>
  <p><strong>The file contains private messages. Keep it somewhere safe.</strong></p>

  <form method="POST" action="/account/export">
    <label>Your password
      <input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password">
    </label>
    <button>Download my data</button>
    <a href="/profile">Cancel</a>
  </form>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
